ext":"そこはviとの互換性が…","ts":"1625393872.306900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ueSKd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a1850aa8-2c7d-4dc7-a69a-cd22ee235dfb","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いまならねーw","ts":"1625393859.306800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hZj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4594372b-accd-4832-a45d-52a6be70c365","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"デフォルトを非再帰的にして、再帰的な方を `nremap` みたいな名前にしたほうが良かったのでは？という気もしなくもない","ts":"1625393837.306400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01PMN2BVJQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qw7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11d5b5a5-dbfd-40b3-a7f5-9d8b6e0f13b8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ここらがVimの穴っていう感じがw","ts":"1625393819.306000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5Sz7"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                *:nore* *:norem*\n:no[remap]  {lhs} {rhs}         |mapmode-nvo|   *:no*  *:noremap* *:nor*\n:nn[oremap] {lhs} {rhs}         |mapmode-n|     *:nn*  *:nnoremap*\n:vn[oremap] {lhs} {rhs}         |mapmode-v|     *:vn*  *:vnoremap*\n:xn[oremap] {lhs} {rhs}         |mapmode-x|     *:xn*  *:xnoremap*\n:snor[emap] {lhs} {rhs}         |mapmode-s|     *:snor* *:snore* *:snoremap*\n:ono[remap] {lhs} {rhs}         |mapmode-o|     *:ono* *:onoremap*\n:no[remap]! {lhs} {rhs}         |mapmode-ic|    *:no!* *:noremap!*\n:ino[remap] {lhs} {rhs}         |mapmode-i|     *:ino* *:inor* *:inoremap*\n:ln[oremap] {lhs} {rhs}         |mapmode-l|     *:ln*  *:lnoremap*\n:cno[remap] {lhs} {rhs}         |mapmode-c|     *:cno* *:cnor* *:cnoremap*\n:tno[remap] {lhs} {rhs}         |mapmode-t|     *:tno* *:tnoremap*\n                        キー入力 {lhs} を {rhs} に割り当てます。作成したマッ\n                        プ、はマップコマンドに対応したモードで使用できます。\n                        {rhs} は再マップされないので、マップが入れ子になったり\n                        再帰的になることはありません。コマンドを再定義するとき\n                        によく使われます。\n```","ts":"1625393785.305500","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"6107d6eb-c598-4d6e-a189-a1933abb7cbe","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":":help noremap","ts":"1625393784.305400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CaJJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"03F48E13-A0BB-4AC7-93D3-FA1D34DC2232","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"その略なんですね。noreってなんだよってずっと思ってた、、","ts":"1625393712.305000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nN4X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"199ca1eb-1707-4c22-a55f-02c48cd11db4","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"基本的に *no*t *re*cursive なので「再帰的に定義を追わない」という理解でよかったはず","ts":"1625393627.304200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/f65"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A9042530-B894-4F2B-8DF2-3B6698DFD07F","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"自分もついこの間それみて学びました。","ts":"1625393584.303700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sohC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a217e34-6fb0-44f4-b62c-c1bba1572b4d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"それで勉強した気がする","ts":"1625391558.302000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SGUV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"817a5928-b845-4bc9-92e3-d91a78371c5c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"すごくよさそう","ts":"1625391478.301700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B7GvP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4958499c-0e67-40d7-a1a9-a75d160e18a3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"これどうでっしゃろ","ts":"1625391418.301500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":3,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","UGH7U3SF2","U013APKV51B"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LQ/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5dcabc6-d8d6-4c29-8413-6ecaacd21598","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"\u003chttps://cocopon.me/blog/2013/10/vim-map-noremap/\u003e","ts":"1625391384.301200","attachments":[{"fallback":"【図解Vim】mapとnoremap - ここぽんのーと","id":1,"title":"【図解Vim】mapとnoremap - ここぽんのーと","title_link":"https://cocopon.me/blog/2013/10/vim-map-noremap/","text":"Vimの設定を少しずつ.vimrcに加えはじめた当時は、mapとnoremapの違いがわからなかった。 情報はWeb上にたくさんあったが、当時の自分にとってはどれも説明が難しくて、しばらく曖昧なまま放置してしまった記憶がある。 そんな昔の自分に向けて、この記事を書いてみる。","image_url":"https://cocopon.me/data/blog/2013/10/vim-map-noremap/plugin-map.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"cocopon.me","from_url":"https://cocopon.me/blog/2013/10/vim-map-noremap/","original_url":"https://cocopon.me/blog/2013/10/vim-map-noremap/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Es1x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2653485a-6a43-497e-9453-a06ee56292d7","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"map と noremap について理解できていない人に投げつけるいい感じの資料なんかあるかな","ts":"1625391362.301000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k1I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7572c598-523e-4231-ad3e-37b45f239eae","type":"message","user":"UGH7U3SF2","text":"なるほど","ts":"1625391350.300700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m1m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b2764b9-fbeb-4e5c-a97f-de71f23d4010","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"このへんですね、 `\u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;` は一度マッピングされたマップなのでnoremap系じゃ使えないという話です","ts":"1625391330.300200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QBU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be81e706-1cd1-4cd3-b77a-2ac4d6fcd4b7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"```:tno[remap] {lhs} {rhs}\t\t|mapmode-t|\t*:tno* *:tnoremap*\n\t\t\tキー入力 {lhs} を {rhs} に割り当てます。作成したマッ\n\t\t\tプ、はマップコマンドに対応したモードで使用できます。\n\t\t\t{rhs} は再マップされないので、マップが入れ子になったり\n\t\t\t再帰的になることはありません。コマンドを再定義するとき\n\t\t\tによく使われます。```","ts":"1625391299.299300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G+bc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f45e0936-15c1-46b8-a49a-eb72c106c7e4","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"そういえば手動でプラグイン放り込んでるけど、packpathに突っ込んで `:packloadall!` する方が楽なのではという気がした","ts":"1625391267.298900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"um1L3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"293b0f76-54e8-4689-b5e5-60dbbd25f862","type":"message","user":"UGH7U3SF2","text":"できましたー！！！！ nmap じゃないと`\u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(quickrun)` が`:\u0026lt;C-u\u0026gt;QuickRun -mode n\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;` を拾ってこれないという認識でいいのですか？","ts":"1625391248.298600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wz3J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77334126-c415-471f-ae26-0941dc67f580","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`nnoremap` じゃなくて `nmap` ですね","ts":"1625391062.296900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y02f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b29998f5-5c63-4134-beae-cd11ffe0c4ef","type":"message","user":"UGH7U3SF2","text":"vim-quickrunへのマッピングがうまくうごいていないのですが、この設定だけで動かすことはそもそも可能ですか？\n一応`:QuickRun` の動作を確認したうえで動かしてもうまくうごいてくれませんでした\n```\" startsetting\nset encoding=utf-8\nset fileencoding=utf-8\nset fileencodings=utf-8,cp932,sjis\nscriptencoding=utf-8\n\nset rtp+=~/vim-quickrun\nlet mapleader = '\\'\nnnoremap \u0026lt;Leader\u0026gt;r \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(quickrun)\n\nfiletype plugin indent on\nsyntax enable```\n","ts":"1625391033.296600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uy61"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73752bcc-e824-4ac5-8187-8b9e6271339b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"だねえ","ts":"1625390814.294900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iZ/z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85BA061E-CBF4-49E2-92B1-72A710BEDC44","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"私はこんなことしている。\n```\" Execute ':helptags ALL' Asynchronously\nif !exists('g:helptags')\n\tif executable(v:progpath) \u0026amp;\u0026amp; exists('*job_start') \u0026amp;\u0026amp; has('vim_starting')\n\t\tcall job_start([\n\t\t\t\\ v:progpath,\n\t\t\t\\ '--cmd', ':let g:helptags = v:true',\n\t\t\t\\ '-c', ':silent! helptags ALL',\n\t\t\t\\ '-c', ':qa!',\n\t\t\t\\ ], {})\n\tendif\nendif```","ts":"1625390701.293900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"asyncparrot","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"48u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3333706e-c951-4681-9cad-afac5749c043","type":"message","user":"UGH7U3SF2","text":"今までさんざんプラグインマネージャに頼りっきりだということがばれてしまった！！","ts":"1625390547.293000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jH7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2feeb1e6-2e6a-4630-b426-ad3b4691cd54","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"プラグインマネージャによっては自動でやってくれるけど、手でやるなら呼んでやる必要がありますね","ts":"1625390502.292400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DFq"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                        *:helpt* *:helptags*\n                                *E154* *E150* *E151* *E152* *E153* *E670*\n:helpt[ags] [++t] {dir}\n                        ディレクトリ {dir} のヘルプタグファイルを作成します。\n                        {dir} が ALL なら 'runtimepath' 内の全ての \"doc\" ディ\n                        レクトリが対象となります。\n \n                        指定されたディレクトリとそのサブディレクトリの \"*.txt\"\n                        と \"*.??x\" というファイルがスキャンされ、スター (*) で\n                        囲まれたタグ定義が検索されます。\"*.??x\" というファイル\n                        は翻訳ヘルプです。\"tags-??\" というタグファイルが生成さ\n                        れます。|help-translated|を参照。作成されたタグファイ\n                        ルはソートされます。\n                        タグの重複があるときはエラーメッセージが表示されます。\n                        すでにあるタグファイルは警告なしに上書きされます。\n \n                        \"++t\" 引数を指定すると \"help-tags\" タグが強制的に追加\n                        されます。これは、{dir} が $VIMRUNTIME/doc と等しいと\n                        きにも同様にタグが追加されます。\n \n                        ランタイムディレクトリのヘルプタグファイルを作成し直す\n                        には次のようにします (ファイルの書き込み権限が必要):  \n                                :helptags $VIMRUNTIME/doc\n```","ts":"1625390479.291900","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"9cb0633e-ac57-452b-a2f3-1d0c8dd1c6e6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h :helptags","ts":"1625390478.291800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hx4o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf05ac75-e24a-4169-8793-154fc07660b9","type":"message","user":"UGH7U3SF2","text":"実行したらよみこまれました！！","ts":"1625390438.291500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tada","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5D1+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce0e4929-dc3c-41e2-8173-b5d5b251e383","type":"message","user":"UGH7U3SF2","text":"実行してないです","ts":"1625390431.291200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+CYF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b2d7bc5-f202-4d9c-bb54-c5338125d323","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"`:helptags ALL` は実行しました？","ts":"1625390402.290900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nQkEt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45af2b4f-4814-484d-92bd-d9b0a4ef3dce","type":"message","user":"UGH7U3SF2","text":"最小環境でプラグインをいれようとしたのですが、helpがよみこまれていなくてこまっています。どのようにすれば簡単にプラグインをヘルプがみれるようにインストールできますか？\n\n\nいかためしたこと\n.vimrc\n```set encoding=utf-8\nset fileencoding=utf-8\nset fileencodings=utf-8,cp932,sjis\nscriptencoding=utf-8\nfiletype plugin indent on\nsyntax enable```\nset packpath? が~/vimfilesだったので~/vimfiles/pack/a/start/のなかにfern.vimをくろーん\nvim起動で:Fern .が動いたのを確認したときにヘルプが表示できません。","ts":"1625390369.290400","edited":{"user":"UGH7U3SF2","ts":"1625390385.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kfb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3B6D4ABE-FCAC-4186-B930-FEC99C19A8A5","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"vimrcを消してください、で解決しそうな気がする\n(求められている回答として適切かはおいといて)","ts":"1625385905.286800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U06ECBRTJ","UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gJFaW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee934cdd-63f5-4260-a2c0-a975d4588ba3","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"kite自身がGUIのプラグインインストーラーを持ってそう","ts":"1625385904.286700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"reADo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2951f953-511b-4579-be97-9afe36593c57","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"手動コピーがなんか変、とか?","ts":"1625385791.284800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KPcZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21ce9006-5023-4a5d-b56e-0092e6172c7c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"どんな導入方法を取ったらこうなるんだろう","ts":"1625385440.284300","edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1625385452.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rFmOj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5f45e86